abstract: >-
  PlantLLPS is a plant-aware sequence scorer for liquid–liquid phase separation
  propensity. GrapeCondensatome is the PlantLLPS-scored UniProt UP000009183
  Vitis vinifera proteome atlas with confidence tiers and UniProt annotation joins.
keywords:
  - liquid-liquid phase separation
  - condensatome
  - Vitis vinifera
  - PlantLLPS
  - microtubule-associated proteins
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "PlantLLPS: a plant-trained predictor of liquid–liquid phase separation and a grapevine whole-proteome condensatome atlas"
  authors:
    - family-names: Guan
      given-names: Pingyin
  notes: "NAR Database draft in docs/MANUSCRIPT.md (synced to software v1.4.0). Cite this software release and the companion MAP/LLPS screen when available. Public URL https://grape-condensatome.apps.grok.bot; Zenodo DOI pending — see docs/ZENODO.md."
